- Dark overlay, red accent.
- Text: “You have been eliminated.”
- Your role revealed: e.g., “You were: Mafia”.
- Button: “Continue as Spectator”.
- Option: “Leave Game”.

**Spectator View:**
- Can see event log and chat but cannot act.
- Can view all roles (if enabled by rules).

